havior when a user attempts to use an already-expired TAN (e.g., error message or disabled action) or how expiration is visually indicated.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n","duration_seconds":205.755909,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":12086,"output_tokens":29648,"thinking_tokens":23586,"cache_read_tokens":0,"total_tokens":41734}}}
